{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a rock knocks you out while climbing the erupting volcano Oden, you wake up near a strange house. People there call themselves your family... but you know they\u2019re not. When a killer breaks in, uncovering the truth can only be done after saving everyone from a harsh and bloody death. Can you make it\u00a0through all the challenges they face?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>TEMPORARY - Update on game development</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I'm sorry to say that I have some VERY important exams this year. I try to develop as much as possible in my free time, but this makes development time very random and therefore I have no clue when the game will be ready to launch. I don't want to rush it either, but I promise that I will attempt to finish it by February/March. Trying to finish the cutscenes at this time so I can create the trailer. Thank you all for waiting! I hope you're as excited as I am!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mechanics/Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decision making</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing music discs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interaction with NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectable notes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moving/Climbing ladders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple quests like:</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Petting a cat</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Throwing wood in a stove</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Watering a plant</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Collecting music discs</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/extras/3ad6794e58a49e113df6c6c6b8c07c4c.avif?t=1768640704\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/extras_big/3ad6794e58a49e113df6c6c6b8c07c4c.avif?t=1768640704 width=1600 height=686 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Description:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>!SPOILERS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After you get past the intro, you go to sleep and you only wake up when a loud noise is heard from somewhere inside the house. After a little investigating, you get trapped upstairs and the rest of your family gets trapped downstairs... with a merciless killer. From there on, you must help them as much as possible by calling the police, distracting the criminal and by getting them all in the basement, the single room they can actually lock.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Should you save them all, the truth will finally come out.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How and why it was made</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After failing to take part in an official game jam, me and my brother decided to compete for 20 dollars. Our mother gave us the theme &quot;Volcano&quot; and he had to make a drawing, while I had to make a game about it. The way the theme is related to this project can be seen in the fourth, cannon ending (which I don't want to spoil). Either way, I knew that adding many mechanics in very little time\u00a0wasn't my strong dev skill at the time so I decided to make a decision based game (I'm not sure if this made things easier).\u00a0 After the competition\u00a0I said that I wanted to polish the final project before releasing it, but after making a new GDD, I might have gone a bit too far (I almost remade the whole game). Well, I hope you'll enjoy it! And I hope the extra effort was worth!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3904890?t=1768640704","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/b96bd6ee166d24e442fd2c9c89f91ccea7ad08eb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768640704","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/1d055e581ae28f6769e22d24c25c64612b31c4fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768640704","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/1d055e581ae28f6769e22d24c25c64612b31c4fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768640704","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a rock knocks you out while climbing the erupting volcano Oden, you wake up near a strange house. People there call themselves your family... but you know they\u2019re not. When a killer breaks in, uncovering the truth can only be done after saving everyone from a harsh and bloody death. Can you make it\u00a0through all the challenges they face?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>TEMPORARY - Update on game development</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I'm sorry to say that I have some VERY important exams this year. I try to develop as much as possible in my free time, but this makes development time very random and therefore I have no clue when the game will be ready to launch. I don't want to rush it either, but I promise that I will attempt to finish it by February/March. Trying to finish the cutscenes at this time so I can create the trailer. Thank you all for waiting! I hope you're as excited as I am!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mechanics/Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decision making</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing music discs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interaction with NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectable notes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moving/Climbing ladders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple quests like:</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Petting a cat</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Throwing wood in a stove</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Watering a plant</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Collecting music discs</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/extras/3ad6794e58a49e113df6c6c6b8c07c4c.avif?t=1768640704\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/extras_big/3ad6794e58a49e113df6c6c6b8c07c4c.avif?t=1768640704 width=1600 height=686 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Description:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>!SPOILERS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After you get past the intro, you go to sleep and you only wake up when a loud noise is heard from somewhere inside the house. After a little investigating, you get trapped upstairs and the rest of your family gets trapped downstairs... with a merciless killer. From there on, you must help them as much as possible by calling the police, distracting the criminal and by getting them all in the basement, the single room they can actually lock.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Should you save them all, the truth will finally come out.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How and why it was made</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After failing to take part in an official game jam, me and my brother decided to compete for 20 dollars. Our mother gave us the theme &quot;Volcano&quot; and he had to make a drawing, while I had to make a game about it. The way the theme is related to this project can be seen in the fourth, cannon ending (which I don't want to spoil). Either way, I knew that adding many mechanics in very little time\u00a0wasn't my strong dev skill at the time so I decided to make a decision based game (I'm not sure if this made things easier).\u00a0 After the competition\u00a0I said that I wanted to polish the final project before releasing it, but after making a new GDD, I might have gone a bit too far (I almost remade the whole game). Well, I hope you'll enjoy it! And I hope the extra effort was worth!</p>","developers":["SBFstudios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/28ddfcc65594c4e2fbdd9c00fc89bab86bd8b6a6/header.jpg?t=1768640704","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Volcano Oden","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz Quad-core Intel or AMD processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1650 Super<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The game at first doesn't open up with the best graphical settings. They can be changed later</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz Quad-core Intel or AMD processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 10 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["SBFstudios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nViol\u00eancia\nAtos criminosos","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt\nDerbe Sprache","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"February 2026"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/e53cd189e4f10a848952848e7d3ac26361d02384/ss_e53cd189e4f10a848952848e7d3ac26361d02384.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768640704","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/e53cd189e4f10a848952848e7d3ac26361d02384/ss_e53cd189e4f10a848952848e7d3ac26361d02384.600x338.jpg?t=1768640704"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/19bac63fd2c3ee481f27523f1f320b21176480cb/ss_19bac63fd2c3ee481f27523f1f320b21176480cb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768640704","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/19bac63fd2c3ee481f27523f1f320b21176480cb/ss_19bac63fd2c3ee481f27523f1f320b21176480cb.600x338.jpg?t=1768640704"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/dc1154a16f50a78ca2572e07bcacd687a0f7af9d/ss_dc1154a16f50a78ca2572e07bcacd687a0f7af9d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768640704","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/dc1154a16f50a78ca2572e07bcacd687a0f7af9d/ss_dc1154a16f50a78ca2572e07bcacd687a0f7af9d.600x338.jpg?t=1768640704"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/a6895627358d07d6d9e61fb309f7b9dc0d246b59/ss_a6895627358d07d6d9e61fb309f7b9dc0d246b59.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768640704","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/a6895627358d07d6d9e61fb309f7b9dc0d246b59/ss_a6895627358d07d6d9e61fb309f7b9dc0d246b59.600x338.jpg?t=1768640704"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/09aef1bc9daea17b25a5eaf476545157285aa3dd/ss_09aef1bc9daea17b25a5eaf476545157285aa3dd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768640704","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/09aef1bc9daea17b25a5eaf476545157285aa3dd/ss_09aef1bc9daea17b25a5eaf476545157285aa3dd.600x338.jpg?t=1768640704"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/4b3fb6abd9fffe1b9f748bed5cd3fae831720bcb/ss_4b3fb6abd9fffe1b9f748bed5cd3fae831720bcb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768640704","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/4b3fb6abd9fffe1b9f748