amstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/38202aa0e96c99fc93b722872d09331da8b7e701/ss_38202aa0e96c99fc93b722872d09331da8b7e701.600x338.jpg?t=1768640704"},{"id":11,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/9d5174df627fd1c1064d5b23d3317b8271bff8b3/ss_9d5174df627fd1c1064d5b23d3317b8271bff8b3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768640704","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/9d5174df627fd1c1064d5b23d3317b8271bff8b3/ss_9d5174df627fd1c1064d5b23d3317b8271bff8b3.600x338.jpg?t=1768640704"},{"id":12,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/247c6f0be5f02adaa1cda40a66653c8a991e4b4d/ss_247c6f0be5f02adaa1cda40a66653c8a991e4b4d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768640704","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/247c6f0be5f02adaa1cda40a66653c8a991e4b4d/ss_247c6f0be5f02adaa1cda40a66653c8a991e4b4d.600x338.jpg?t=1768640704"},{"id":13,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/278cbc2714ccfe840df33dffb3ad19105a840dd0/ss_278cbc2714ccfe840df33dffb3ad19105a840dd0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768640704","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/278cbc2714ccfe840df33dffb3ad19105a840dd0/ss_278cbc2714ccfe840df33dffb3ad19105a840dd0.600x338.jpg?t=1768640704"},{"id":14,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/d6d71706a18eb0032b63aac647a2b48247c8baef/ss_d6d71706a18eb0032b63aac647a2b48247c8baef.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768640704","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/d6d71706a18eb0032b63aac647a2b48247c8baef/ss_d6d71706a18eb0032b63aac647a2b48247c8baef.600x338.jpg?t=1768640704"},{"id":15,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904890/86a9e236507687d1c942223c01d5da9867f2b915/ss_86a9e236507687d1c942223c01d5da9867f2b